---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="FEA E-Book"
	description="Learn practical finite element analysis with Nick Stevens' concise, field-tested e-book"
>
	<style>
		.ebook-intro {
			margin-bottom: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
		}

		.ebook-cta {
			--cta-surface: oklch(22% 0.034 247 / 0.82);
			--cta-surface-strong: oklch(28% 0.048 247 / 0.8);
			--cta-text: oklch(98% 0.006 247);
			--cta-muted: oklch(79% 0.032 247);
			--cta-border: oklch(70% 0.09 247 / 0.32);
			--cta-accent: oklch(69% 0.145 247);
			--cta-accent-strong: oklch(61% 0.17 247);
			--cta-amber: oklch(75% 0.16 76);
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
			gap: clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 2rem);
			align-items: center;
			margin: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem) 0 0;
			padding: clamp(1.15rem, 4vw, 1.75rem);
			border: 1px solid var(--cta-border);
			border-radius: 14px;
			background:
				linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cta-surface), var(--cta-surface-strong)),
				var(--surface-alt);
			box-shadow: 0 18px 48px oklch(10% 0.03 247 / 0.28);
		}

		.ebook-cta-copy {
			display: grid;
			gap: 0.75rem;
		}

		.ebook-cta-kicker {
			margin: 0;
			color: var(--cta-amber);
			font-size: 0.76rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			letter-spacing: 0.08em;
			line-height: 1.2;
			text-transform: uppercase;
		}

		.ebook-cta h2 {
			margin: 0;
			color: var(--cta-text);
			font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.9rem);
			line-height: 1.12;
		}

		.ebook-cta p {
			max-width: 58ch;
			margin: 0;
			color: var(--cta-muted);
			font-size: 0.98rem;
			line-height: 1.55;
		}

		.ebook-outcomes {
			display: flex;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			gap: 0.45rem;
			margin-top: 0.15rem;
		}

		.ebook-outcome {
			display: inline-flex;
			align-items: center;
			min-height: 1.9rem;
			padding: 0.24rem 0.62rem;
			border: 1px solid oklch(76% 0.07 247 / 0.25);
			border-radius: 999px;
			color: var(--cta-text);
			background: oklch(98% 0.006 247 / 0.06);
			font-size: 0.78rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			line-height: 1.2;
		}

		.ebook-buy {
			box-sizing: border-box;
			display: inline-flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			min-width: 12rem;
			min-height: 3rem;
			padding: 0.78rem 1.1rem;
			border: 1px solid oklch(78% 0.11 247 / 0.44);
			border-radius: 12px;
			background: var(--cta-accent);
			color: oklch(99% 0.004 247);
			font-weight: 700;
			line-height: 1.2;
			text-align: center;
			text-decoration: none;
			box-shadow: 0 12px 28px oklch(13% 0.04 247 / 0.3);
			transition:
				background-color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
				border-color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
				box-shadow 180ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
				color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
				transform 180ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
		}

		.ebook-buy:hover,
		.ebook-buy:focus-visible {
			background: var(--cta-accent-strong);
			border-color: oklch(82% 0.11 247 / 0.58);
			color: oklch(99% 0.004 247);
			text-decoration: none;
			box-shadow: 0 16px 34px oklch(13% 0.04 247 / 0.36);
			transform: translateY(-1px);
		}

		.ebook-buy:focus-visible {
			outline: 3px solid oklch(82% 0.13 247 / 0.36);
			outline-offset: 3px;
		}

		:global(html[data-theme='light']) .ebook-cta {
			--cta-surface: oklch(98% 0.009 247 / 0.98);
			--cta-surface-strong: oklch(94% 0.025 247 / 0.98);
			--cta-text: oklch(22% 0.035 247);
			--cta-muted: oklch(42% 0.036 247);
			--cta-border: oklch(68% 0.09 247 / 0.32);
			--cta-accent: oklch(57% 0.18 247);
			--cta-accent-strong: oklch(49% 0.19 247);
			--cta-amber: oklch(52% 0.14 76);
			box-shadow: 0 16px 36px oklch(70% 0.04 247 / 0.25);
		}

		:global(html[data-theme='light']) .ebook-outcome {
			border-color: oklch(64% 0.08 247 / 0.32);
			background: oklch(99% 0.006 247 / 0.7);
		}

		@media (max-width: 720px) {
			.ebook-cta {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}

			.ebook-buy {
				width: 100%;
			}
		}

		@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
			.ebook-buy {
				transition: none;
			}

			.ebook-buy:hover,
			.ebook-buy:focus-visible {
				transform: none;
			}
		}
	</style>

	<div class="ebook-intro">
		<p>
			Want to produce stronger, more credible FEA in less time?
		</p>
		<p>
			This e-book is a practical guide built for engineers who need to go beyond button-clicking: better model setup,
			smarter assumptions, cleaner validation, and clearer reporting. It's focused, usable, and designed to help you
			make better engineering decisions with confidence.
		</p>
		<p>
			Whether you're early in your FEA journey or sharpening an established workflow, this resource gives you a
			structured path to improve analysis quality and reduce avoidable mistakes.
		</p>
	</div>

	<section class="ebook-cta" aria-labelledby="ebook-buy-heading">
		<div class="ebook-cta-copy">
			<p class="ebook-cta-kicker">Practical FEA guide</p>
			<h2 id="ebook-buy-heading">Improve the next model you build.</h2>
			<p>
				Get the e-book for a focused path through assumptions, validation, and reporting, written for engineers who
				need analysis they can defend.
			</p>
			<div class="ebook-outcomes" aria-label="Topics covered">
				<span class="ebook-outcome">Model setup</span>
				<span class="ebook-outcome">Validation checks</span>
				<span class="ebook-outcome">Clear reporting</span>
			</div>
		</div>
		<a class="ebook-buy" href="https://nickjstevens.gumroad.com/l/Aougc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
			Buy on Gumroad
		</a>
	</section>
</Layout>
